{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>From the pits.</b> It has no cognate, and likewise זג (grape-skin). The commentators said חרצנים are the outer skins and זג the inner; others reversed the interpretation. Thus the sense of 'from the pits' joins with 'from all that is made' — everything made from these two."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:29.297968624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}